<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CVForge UG — Professional CVs</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f6f7f9;
      color: #111;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      padding: 22px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: #36d399;
    }

    header a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px;
      background: white;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 70px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #16a36b;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: auto;
      color: #555;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 15px 28px;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #16a36b;
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 8%;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section-title {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      font-size: 35px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .price {
      font-size: 30px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    .popular {
      border: 2px solid #16a36b;
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 25px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 45px;
      height: 45px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .payment {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }

    .payment-number {
      font-size: 30px;
      color: #36d399;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
      background: #111;
      color: #aaa;
      margin-top: 50px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      header {
        padding: 18px 5%;
      }

      section {
        padding: 55px 5%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">CVForge<span>UG</span></div>
  <a href="#order">Order CV</a>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <h1>Get a CV that gets you <span>noticed.</span></h1>

  <p>
    Professional, modern CVs and application documents
    designed for students, graduates and job seekers in Uganda.
  </p>

  <a href="#order" class="btn">Create My CV →</a>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 class="section-title">Simple pricing</h2>

  <div class="cards">

    <div class="card">
      <h3>CV Only</h3>
      <p>Professional CV designed around your experience.</p>
      <div class="price">20K UGX</div>
      <a href="#order" class="btn">Order</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card popular">
      <h3>CV + Cover Letter</h3>
      <p>Professional CV plus a tailored cover letter.</p>
      <div class="price">30K UGX</div>
      <a href="#order" class="btn">Order</a>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Application Pack</h3>
      <p>CV, cover letter and professional LinkedIn bio.</p>
      <div class="price">50K UGX</div>
      <a href="#order" class="btn">Order</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2 class="section-title">How it works</h2>

  <div class="steps">

    <div>
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <h3>Send your details</h3>
      <p>Tell us about your education, experience and the job you're applying for.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <h3>Make payment</h3>
      <p>Pay through Mobile Money using the number below.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <h3>We build it</h3>
      <p>We create your professional application documents.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <div class="step-number">4</div>
      <h3>Receive your CV</h3>
      <p>Your finished documents are delivered digitally.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section id="order">

  <div class="payment">

    <h2>Ready to upgrade your CV?</h2>

    <p>Send your payment through Mobile Money:</p>

    <div class="payment-number">
      077268690360
    </div>

    <p>
      After payment, send your payment confirmation and
      your CV information through WhatsApp.
    </p>

    <a
      class="btn"
      href="https://wa.me/25677268690360?text=Hi%20CVForge%20UG,%20I%20want%20to%20order%20a%20CV."
      target="_blank">
      Order via WhatsApp →
    </a>

  </div>

</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 CVForge UG · Professional CV & Application Services
</footer>

</body>
</html>
